{"version":1,"content":"<p>SK海力士已放棄其子公司Solidigm在美國上市的計劃，此前該計劃因可能損害少數股東利益而遭到股東的強烈反對和監管機構的審查。根據周五提交的一份監管文件，這家韓國晶片製造商還暫停了與該上市計劃同步推進的IPO前融資流程。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583508.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.935587+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"7a8af0d464e68f3cbcce51eab251caa5acbef0b76d90db4f87269086ed94bb39","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}